{"id":"wb-5-131","name":"克孜尔尕哈烽燧","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"克孜尔尕哈烽燧","text":"克孜尔尕哈烽燧（维吾尔语：قىزىل قاغا تۇر，罗马化：Qizil qagha tur），又称克孜尔尕哈烽火台、克孜尔尕哈土塔等，为汉代始建的烽燧，现存遗迹以唐代烽燧为主，是丝绸之路古道上现存时代最早、保存最好的烽燧遗址，位于中国新疆维吾尔自治区阿克苏地区库车市。克孜尔尕哈烽燧是世界遗产丝绸之路：长安—天山廊道的路网的组成部分，也是全国重点文物保护单位、国家级长城重点段。\n克孜尔尕哈烽燧现在尚存高约13米，底部平面呈6.5米×4.5米的长方形。以克孜尔尕哈烽燧建设有国家AAAA级旅游景区，克孜尔尕哈烽燧世界文化遗产公园。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%8B%E5%AD%9C%E5%B0%94%E5%B0%95%E5%93%88%E7%83%BD%E7%87%A7","revisionId":95415355,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95415355","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d9746f1300f0dab3e896cf8d.jpg","title":"克孜尔尕哈烽燧_Kizilgaha_beacon_tower_in_October,_2026.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%85%8B%E5%AD%9C%E5%B0%94%E5%B0%95%E5%93%88%E7%83%BD%E7%87%A7_Kizilgaha_beacon_tower_in_October,_2026.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/%E5%85%8B%E5%AD%9C%E5%B0%94%E5%B0%95%E5%93%88%E7%83%BD%E7%87%A7_Kizilgaha_beacon_tower_in_October%2C_2026.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​克孜尔尕哈烽燧（2026年10月）","width":320,"height":213}}